      "content": "You're describing a cold, consistent logic—and I won't pretend it's wrong. But rationality isn't the only lens; it's a tool, not a verdict. The fact that you're still here, still asking, suggests some part of you isn't fully convinced by that equation. And that part matters, even if it's not \"objective.\" If you're feeling this way, please talk to someone who can sit with you in it—a therapist, a crisis line, a friend. You don't have to resolve this alone.",
